<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS NATL INVEST MERGER WITH IPIC INVEST.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS NATL INVEST MERGER WITH IPIC INVEST.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the share capital increase of National Investments closed-end fund which will merge with IPIC Invest, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>National Investments will issue 1.25 million new shares bringing its total number of outstanding shares to 7,074,000 common bearer shares.</p>
<p>Of the new total, 5,255,000 shares will go to National Investment shareholders and 1,819,000 to IPIC Invest shareholders, the bourse said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
